# Agent workspace migration

When the user asks to clean or migrate **agent profile clutter**, **legacy AgentTemp**, or **home agent utilities**:

1. Load skill **`agent-workspace-migrate`** and read **`general/agent-workspace-migrate.md`**.
2. Explain policy (**workspace** / **utilities** / **temp/scratch** vs native **spill**).
3. Run lock/writability probes; optional handle listing if probes fail.
4. Ask user to confirm **no other agents** are operating on the same paths.
5. Write **`PLAN.md`** + **`manifest.csv`** under **`temp/scratch/…/agent-workspace-migrate/`**; get approval before moves.
6. Never move **`agent-tools`** spill into the workspace; no shared cleanup scripts in agent-rules.

Cross-platform detail: **`general/agent-workspace-migrate.md`**.
